 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ARITH-DEMO.

 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 A PIC 9(3) VALUE 12.
 01 B PIC 9(3) VALUE 8.
 01 RESULT PIC 9(4)V99.

 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     DISPLAY "A = " A.
     DISPLAY "B = " B.
     ADD A B GIVING RESULT.
     DISPLAY "A + B = " RESULT.
     SUBTRACT B FROM A GIVING RESULT.
     DISPLAY "A - B = " RESULT.
     MULTIPLY A BY B GIVING RESULT.
     DISPLAY "A * B = " RESULT.
     DIVIDE B INTO A GIVING RESULT.
     DISPLAY "A / B = " RESULT.
     STOP RUN.
